UN Framework: Relevant Documents 
In this section, you can add UN Resolutions, Treaties, Agreements, or anything that has been signed 
or adopted by Member States within the Framework of the United Nations in chronological order. 
You should include the Date of the Document, a short description of its content or aim, as well as the 
state of its implementation. Add a footnote with a link to the full text of each document. 
Paris Agreement (2015)
3
 
“The Paris Agreement is a legally binding international treaty on climate change. It was adopted by 
195 Parties at the UN Climate Change Conference (COP21) in Paris, France, on 12 December 2015. It 
entered into force on 4 November 2016. Currently, as of 27 January 2026, there are 194 Parties to the 
Paris Agreement.”
4
 
